{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/c29c1c242df61064e7e6f39eb53f4cd4.poster.avif?t=1760913997\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/c29c1c242df61064e7e6f39eb53f4cd4.webm?t=1760913997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/c29c1c242df61064e7e6f39eb53f4cd4.mp4?t=1760913997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an operator in a retro-futuristic dystopia where cameras track every citizen\u2019s move. Feel the moral weight and eerie atmosphere in the style of <i><strong>Papers, Please</strong></i>. Monitor people, enforce strict laws, uncover secrets, and make decisions that could change everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/239283dc806c68bdc74ea07d6c8b64e0.poster.avif?t=1760913997\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/239283dc806c68bdc74ea07d6c8b64e0.webm?t=1760913997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/239283dc806c68bdc74ea07d6c8b64e0.mp4?t=1760913997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Intriguing World</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face a wide range of cases demanding your attention and judgment. News feeds reveal a deep story, pulling you into a gripping narrative. Laws shift over time, forcing you to adapt your approach to new cases. And remember: every decision strengthens or weakens your loyalty to the System!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/f09ed25bb8e5a69c136079629a0530af.poster.avif?t=1760913997\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/f09ed25bb8e5a69c136079629a0530af.webm?t=1760913997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/f09ed25bb8e5a69c136079629a0530af.mp4?t=1760913997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every choice comes at a cost and is closely watched by a distant Department. Will you follow the System\u2019s rigid demands? Join a secret resistance? Embrace the cold logic of the AI? Or perhaps find an unexpected path of your own? The world reacts to your actions, and its fate ultimately depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/40062232ed35aa6fb1b837643ed502f6.poster.avif?t=1760913997\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/40062232ed35aa6fb1b837643ed502f6.webm?t=1760913997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/40062232ed35aa6fb1b837643ed502f6.mp4?t=1760913997\" type=\"vi